& [Implementation]
  + CatalogueIdentity now commits a caller-supplied stable logical revision in both derivation and catalogue roots
  + CatalogueDerivationRequest binds stable catalogue identity and logical revision without a live clock
  + FabricGenerationIdentity commits sorted package digest certificate semantic root source root compiler version and authority-scope evidence
  + derive_semantic_anchor_catalogue reads one already admitted SemanticFabric and emits a disposable DerivedSemanticAnchorCatalogue
  + every admitted semantic unit becomes one exact SemanticAddress and IdentityAnchorEntry with unit digest content-addressed meaning and context package certificate source anchors labels purpose lifecycle and relation references
  + exact_label_index and relation_adjacency are deterministic BTree projections checked against admitted exact indexes and relations
  + Operation units remain identity-addressable but become typed CatalogueDerivationOmission records when structured roles class effects and applicability are absent
  + derived proof digest commits generation catalogue labels adjacency and omissions under a separate SHA-256 domain
  + validate_derived_semantic_anchor_catalogue canonically rebuilds the complete artifact from the same admitted fabric and rejects any difference

& [IdentityBoundary]
  + admitted package records remain the sole authority store while the derived catalogue is disposable and reproducible
  + meaning and context content identities commit exact values but are not separately admitted semantic records
  + package compiler catalogue compiler certificate catalogue fabric unit meaning context and proof identities remain distinct
  + UnitStatus epistemic states do not become package lifecycle claims except explicit Superseded maps to the catalogue superseded lifecycle
  + relation adjacency preserves exact relation identity without copying relation claims into endpoint identity

& [NoInferenceBoundary]
  + no operation verb role class effect authority precondition invariant postcondition failure applicability or non-transfer field is guessed from expression alias meaning or prose
  + each affected Operation unit receives one sorted proof-committed omission with the exact unsupported field set and reason
  + operation entries and applicability bindings remain empty until a separately admitted structured operation contract exists

& [Acceptance]
  + 16 focused semantic-anchor tests pass including seven new Slice2 derivation tests
  + order-permuted package inputs serialize to byte-identical derived artifacts
  + unit meaning relation type and source-byte changes alter generation catalogue and proof commitments
  + exact unit package certificate source label and relation correspondence is asserted
  + operation omissions logical revision unknown fields index proof root and missing-source mutations fail closed
  + full workspace tests pass with 775 passed 0 failed and 1 governed ignored test
  + full workspace all-target all-feature Clippy passes with warnings denied
  + cargo format diff check and five-case offline bounded-verification harness pass

& [Rollback]
  + remove Slice2 derivation types functions tests source review phase lock solution proof and records
  + remove logical_revision from CatalogueIdentity and its two digest tuples if reverting all Slice2 machine-form changes
  + retain Slice1 direct Cantor query and iterative-attention behavior without storage migration

& [Deferred]
  + Slice3 exact scanner and all lexical learned provider persistence remote hidden-state effect FPGA and Minecraft behavior remain unimplemented and unactivated
